            <ArticleTitle>Trunk strength testing with iso-machines. Part 1: Review of a decade of scientific evidence.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>801-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review of the scientific literature on isokinetic and isoinertial testing of dynamic trunk strength related to low back pain using &quot;iso-machines&quot; identified 108 items published in the past decade. There was inadequate scientific evidence to support the use of iso-machines in preemployment screening, routine clinical assessment or medico-legal evaluation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
